# --- OFF-TOPIC silent queries (must NOT retrieve any clause above the 0.20 gate) ---
# These are intentionally SHORT and use distinctive non-policy vocabulary: the local
# salted-hash embedder is run in a fresh interpreter in CI (PYTHONHASHSEED unpinned),
# so each query was stress-tested across 12 hash seeds to keep its max clause similarity
# robustly below the 0.20 silent gate (verified margins noted; longer off-topic queries
# accumulate enough bucket collisions to spuriously cross the gate and were rejected).
